# Trivy ignore file
# Add CVE IDs to ignore specific vulnerabilities
# Format: CVE-YYYY-NNNNN

# Example: Ignore low-severity CVEs in development dependencies
# CVE-2023-12345

# Ignore vulnerabilities that have been assessed and accepted
# Document the reason for ignoring

# False positives
# CVE-2023-XXXXX  # False positive - not applicable to our usage

# Accepted risks (with justification)
# CVE-2023-YYYYY  # Accepted - mitigation in place via network policies
